{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜蘋果Swift學生挑戰賽2月8日起收件 傑出得獎者可赴美交流           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">蘋果公布新一屆Swift學生挑戰賽將於2月8日開放申請，全球學生可提交任何Apple平台的原創App作品。評審會按創新性、創造力、社會影響力或包容性選出得獎者，得獎者可獲一年免費Apple Developer Program會籍及紀念品，傑出得獎者則獲邀前往美國Cupertino蘋果總部交流。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:21.225989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T11:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:56.147780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:56.147780+00:00","content_hash":"212aacc4b11816a8fbde3394dd723c4e883db69a7abf07f95137890fe202d287","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}